# Git LFS: large binary files are stored on the LFS server, and clones fetch them on checkout.
#
# Patterns are scoped to project folders whose files are NOT yet committed. A broad `*.blend`
# would make git report every blend already committed as a regular file (292 of them) as
# modified. To put a new project's large files on LFS, add a line for its folder before its
# first commit, for example:
#   model_projects/<project>/**/*.blend filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
model_projects/thorvald_starport/**/*.blend filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
